>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TEST-RECURRENCE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "appointment-status.cpy".
COPY "appointment-date-params.cpy".
01 TEST-STATUS PIC 9(3).
01 FAILURES PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 20240101 TO ADP-INPUT-DATE MOVE "W" TO ADP-RECURRENCE
    CALL "APPOINTMENT-RECURRENCE" USING APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS TEST-STATUS
    IF ADP-OUTPUT-DATE NOT = 20240108 ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    INITIALIZE APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS
    MOVE 20240101 TO ADP-INPUT-DATE MOVE "B" TO ADP-RECURRENCE
    CALL "APPOINTMENT-RECURRENCE" USING APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS TEST-STATUS
    IF ADP-OUTPUT-DATE NOT = 20240115 ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    INITIALIZE APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS
    MOVE 20240131 TO ADP-INPUT-DATE MOVE "M" TO ADP-RECURRENCE MOVE 31 TO ADP-ANCHOR-DAY
    CALL "APPOINTMENT-RECURRENCE" USING APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS TEST-STATUS
    IF ADP-OUTPUT-DATE NOT = 20240229 ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    INITIALIZE APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS
    MOVE 20240229 TO ADP-INPUT-DATE MOVE "Y" TO ADP-RECURRENCE MOVE 29 TO ADP-ANCHOR-DAY
    CALL "APPOINTMENT-RECURRENCE" USING APPOINTMENT-DATE-PARAMS TEST-STATUS
    IF ADP-OUTPUT-DATE NOT = 20250228 ADD 1 TO FAILURES END-IF
    DISPLAY "recurrence tests failures=" FAILURES
    MOVE FAILURES TO RETURN-CODE GOBACK.
END PROGRAM TEST-RECURRENCE.
